                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "226289181",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198361517244",
                            "num_reviews": 52,
                            "playtime_forever": 232,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 230,
                            "last_played": 1779773064
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It would be ok good if it wasn't extremely laggy... you heard right LAGGY on parts like the escape from the Volcano.... Very annoying and buggy... I would like to kick the person in the head who left it this way.... Making some of the potentially most fun parts hell and crap!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1779610465,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1779610465,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 0,
                        "votes_funny": 0,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.5,
                        "comment_count": 0,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Hello. \n\nSometimes the powerfull computers don't use the GPU to make the game run, it uses your CPU and the game tends to be laggy. The game should run at around 60 FPS if the GPU is beeing used. :) You can make your computer to force to use the GPU to play the game. :) \n\nYou can try : \n\n1. Right click the name of the game in steam library, go to Properties\n2. Click on \"Set Launch Options\"\n3. In the box that opens up type \" -gl \" without the quotation marks. \n\nHope it will help.\n\nP.S : The Volcano escape is the most difficult mini game of this type, we wanted to reduce the difficulty after release, but people had a mixed wills about this part of the game, some wanted to keep it like that, and others no ahah. We encourage you to overcome this difficulty and continue your adventure. We can help you to go trough this if you give us your save too. :) ",
                        "timestamp_dev_responded": 1779874051,
                        "primarily_steam_deck": false,
                        "refunded": false
                    }
                ],
